{"articleNo":"104218","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=104218&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"주차관리시스템 변경에 따른 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.03.24","hit":"5222","attachments":[{"name":"주차요금환불신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=104218&attachNo=72344"},{"name":"정기권 등록차량 현황.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=104218&attachNo=72458"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">주차관리시스템 변경에 따른 안내&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">통합무인경비시스템 용역 계약에 따른 계약자인 (주)에스원에서 무상으로 학내 주차시스템(R/F카드인식시스템)을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">차량번호 인식시스템</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">으로 변경교체함에 따라 다음과 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">같이 안내하오니 참고하셔서 이용에 불편이 없도록 하여 주시기 바랍</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">니다.</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 변경 내용</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. R/F카드 인식시스템에서 차량번호 인식시스템으로 변경</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 기존 정기권 발급시 등록된 차량만 인식</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 추진일정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">정기주차권 차량 변경 신청 : 2014.3.20(목) ~ 3.28(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 주차관리시스템 변경 공사 : 2014.3.28(금) ~ 3.30(일)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; TEXT-DECORATION: underline; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"> 차량번호 인식시스템 시행일자 : 2014.3.31(월)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #009900; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">전자인식표(R/F카드) 보증금 환불 신청 : 2014.3.31(월) ~ 8.29(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 행정사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">정기주차권 차량 변경 신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">- 대상 : 현재 이용하는 차량번호와 등록한 차량번호가 서로 상이한 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">정기권&nbsp;차량(차량변경이 없는 정기권 차량은 신청 제외)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 제출서류 : 자동차등록증 사본</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">※ 기존 정기권 발급시 등록된 차량번호만 인식되므로 미변경시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">일반 주차요금 부과</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #009900; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">전자인식표(R/F카드) 보증금 환불 신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 대상 : 정기권 발급자 전체</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 제출서류 : 주차요금 환불신청서(붙임 참조)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제출방법 : 직접제출(본관403호, 주차행정실), Fax : 478-7156</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 문의사항 : 주차행정실(☎478-7903)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 정기권 등록차량 현황 1부. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 주차요금 환불신청서 1부.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">&nbsp; 교 통 관 리 위 원 회</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
